      "description": "Magic UI dock with shadcn link controls; four labeled destinations remain visible on all viewports.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-dock\" aria-label=\"Workspace\"><a href=\"#home\" aria-current=\"page\" aria-label=\"Home\" title=\"Home\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 10 12 3l9 7v10h-6v-7H9v7H3Z\"/></svg></a><a href=\"#profiles\" aria-label=\"Profiles\" title=\"Profiles\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 5h7l2 3h9v12H3Z\"/></svg></a><a href=\"#record\" aria-label=\"Career Record\" title=\"Career Record\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 4h4v16H4Zm7 0h4v16h-4Zm7 0h3v16h-3Z\"/></svg></a><a href=\"#settings\" aria-label=\"Settings\" title=\"Settings\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v3m0 12v3M3 12h3m12 0h3M6 6l2 2m8 8 2 2M6 18l2-2M16 8l2-2M16 12a4 4 0 1 1-8 0 4 4 0 0 1 8 0Z\"/></svg></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-dock{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:1rem;background:var(--card);color:var(--foreground);height:72px;width:max-content;max-width:100%;font:500 12px/1.2 var(--font-sans,system-ui)}.ds-dock a{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;width:48px;min-height:48px;padding:8px 4px;border-radius:var(--radius-lg,.625rem);color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.ds-dock svg{width:22px;height:22px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.5}.ds-dock a:hover{background:var(--muted)}.ds-dock a[aria-current]{background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-foreground)}.ds-dock a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:4px}",
      "refersTo": "workspace-dock"
    },
    {
      "name": "Language badge",
      "kind": "chip",
      "description": "Owned shadcn secondary badge.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-badge\">English</span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:20px;padding:2px 8px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:999px;background:var(--secondary);color:var(--foreground);font:500 12px var(--font-sans,system-ui)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Editor container",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "editor-container",
      "description": "Bordered domain layout container, not a Card primitive.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-editor\"><h2>Experience</h2><p>Shape the wording for this Resume.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-editor{padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-xl,.875rem);background:var(--card);color:var(--foreground);font:400 15px/1.6 var(--font-sans,system-ui)}.ds-editor h2{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em}.ds-editor p{margin:0;color:var(--muted-foreground);font-size:14px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Dark mode switch",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "theme-switch",
      "description": "shadcn Base UI switch appearance in Settings; static HTML preview uses a checkbox.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-switch-label\">Dark mode<input class=\"ds-switch\" type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-switch-label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;color:var(--foreground);font:500 14px var(--font-sans,system-ui)}.ds-switch{appearance:none;position:relative;width:32px;height:18.4px;margin:0;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:999px;background:var(--input);cursor:pointer}.ds-switch:before{content:\"\";display:block;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--background);transform:translateX(0)}.ds-switch:checked{background:var(--primary)}.ds-switch:checked:before{transform:translateX(14px)}.ds-switch:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:4px}.ds-switch:hover{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in oklch,var(--ring) 50%,transparent)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Section tabs",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Existing shadcn Base UI line tabs; inactive panels remain mounted for autosave.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-section-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Career Record sections\"><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">Basics</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Experience</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Education</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-section-tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;overflow-x:auto;padding:4px 0 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font:500 14px var(--font-sans,system-ui)}.ds-section-tabs button{position:relative;flex:none;min-height:40px;padding:2px 12px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--radius-md,.5rem);background:transparent;color:var(--muted-foreground);font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.ds-section-tabs button[aria-selected=true]{color:var(--foreground)}.ds-section-tabs button[aria-selected=true]:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:-5px;height:2px;background:var(--foreground)}.ds-section-tabs button:hover{color:var(--foreground)}.ds-section-tabs button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sortable collapsed entry",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Cult UI sortable-list adaptation with a Base UI Button drag handle and shadcn Collapsible summary. Preview depicts the collapsed appearance; runtime provides drag and ArrowUp/ArrowDown reordering.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-sort-entry\"><button class=\"ds-sort-grip\" aria-label=\"Reorder Experience entry\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 5h.01M9 12h.01M9 19h.01M15 5h.01M15 12h.01M15 19h.01\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-sort-summary\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>Experience entry<small>Organization</small></span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-sort-entry{position:relative;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-lg,.625rem);color:var(--foreground);background:var(--card);font:500 14px var(--font-sans,system-ui)}.ds-sort-entry button{border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--radius-lg,.625rem);background:transparent;color:inherit;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.ds-sort-grip{position:absolute;top:12px;left:8px;display:grid;place-items:center;width:32px;min-height:36px;touch-action:none;cursor:grab!important}.ds-sort-grip:active{cursor:grabbing!important}.ds-sort-entry svg{width:16px;height:16px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round}.ds-sort-summary{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;width:100%;min-height:56px;padding:12px 16px 12px 44px;text-align:start}.ds-sort-summary small{display:block;margin-top:4px;color:var(--muted-foreground);font-weight:400}.ds-sort-entry button:hover{background:var(--muted)}.ds-sort-entry button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:4px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Production ledger",
    "overview": "Production ledger is a warm, restrained working environment for deliberate career writing. Ink-green text, forest-green actions and fine neutral rules establish hierarchy without ornamental effects. The user-approved replacement identity removes the former purple direction.\n\nCompact controls and clear typography keep real document names, content and persistence feedback prominent. The same hierarchy continues on dark neutral-green surfaces; the exported Resume template keeps its own isolated document styling.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Warm neutral surfaces and a restrained forest-green accent.",
      "Ruled lists and flat working panes.",
      "Locally hosted type, visible focus and restrained motion."
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "Do apply app colors through the semantic theme tokens in src/app/globals.css.",
      "Do reuse existing shadcn Base UI controls before adding approved registry components.",
      "Do preserve light/dark hierarchy, visible focus and reduced-motion behavior.",
      "Do keep Arabic RTL support and LTR email/URL values intact."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't reintroduce the replaced purple identity.",
      "Don't add decorative motion or effects for their own sake.",
      "Don't substitute Radix asChild examples for Base UI render composition.",
      "Don't let app theme styling leak into the exported Resume template."
    ]
  }
}
